## Changes Summary

| Change | Details |
|--------|---------|
| **Main container** | Removed `opacity-0` class that was hiding the entire component |
| **AppWindow visibility** | Changed from opacity-based hiding to `invisible`/`visible` classes - preserves layout space while hiding content |
| **Loading animation** | Now fully visible during load state since parent container is not hidden |
| **Layout preservation** | Using `invisible` instead of `hidden` maintains the flex layout structure |

**Result:** The loading spinner and message are now clearly visible while the AppWindow remains hidden until the iframe loads completely.
